{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23540","headline":"去岁罢杭州今春领吴郡慙无善政聊写鄙怀兼寄三相公 · 白居易","name":"去岁罢杭州今春领吴郡慙无善政聊写鄙怀兼寄三相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲问三丞相，如何秉国钧。\n那将最剧郡，付与苦慵人。\n岂有吟诗客，堪爲持节臣。\n不才空饱暖，无惠及饥贫。\n昨卧南城月，今行北境春。\n铅刀磨欲尽，银印换何频。\n杭老遮车辙，吴童扫路尘。\n虚迎复虚送，慙见两州民。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23540.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23540","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}